  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into 1cm-thick wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast for 15 minutes (it will finish roasting in step 4!).\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if preferred!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-e3e4b300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter over medium heat. Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-3aef3510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Trim baby broccoli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-baefe020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce and honey.\n• Drizzle roasted pumpkin with the honey-soy mixture, then sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds.\n• Roast pumpkin until golden and tender, a further 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-23162730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pumpkin is finishing, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with sesame oil blend.\n• Cook baby broccoli until just tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens, ginger paste and remaining garlic and cook, stirring, until greens are slightly wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-0ca6d240.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with ginger greens and honey-soy pumpkin, spooning over any sauce from the oven tray.\n• Drizzle over sesame dressing.\n• Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709912c30d33981f992d7c/step-674c0550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
